---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
---

<Base title="Terms of use" description="Terms for using the Gourwest ordering simulator.">
  <PageIntro label="Legal" title="Terms of use" lead="Last updated 18 November 2026." />
  <Prose>
    <h2>A demonstration, not a restaurant</h2>
    <p>
      Gourwest is fictional. Menu items, prices, nutrition figures, locations and opening hours are synthetic demo data. Orders placed here are not
      cooked or delivered, and no payment is taken.
    </p>

    <h2>Orders</h2>
    <p>
      Placing an order sends one record to Luminara CRM for demonstration. Each checkout is sent once; if the site reports that the kitchen system was slow
      to respond, the order may still have been recorded, so check before placing it again.
    </p>

    <h2>Allergens and nutrition</h2>
    <p>Allergen and nutrition information is illustrative. Do not rely on it for medical or dietary decisions.</p>

    <h2>Menu concierge</h2>
    <p>The concierge suggests dishes from the menu. Suggestions may be imperfect; always check the dish page and the allergen guide.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Don’t submit real personal or payment information, attempt to disrupt the service, or send automated traffic. We may block requests that do.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Use the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
